===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A person who does not follow an [[Abrahamic]] [[religion]]; a [[pagan]].
#* V. Knox
#*: If it is no more than a moral discourse, he may preach it and they may hear it, and yet both continue unconverted '''heathens'''.
# {{context|by extension|lang=en}} An uncultured or uncivilized  person, [[philistine]].
# {{alternative case form of|Heathen|nodot=1|lang=en}} {{qualifier|an adherent of the Germanic [[neo-pagan]] faith of [[Heathenry]]}}.

